      },
      "note": [
        "Students in this table refer to those students who each year have achieved eligibility for post-secondary studies from folk high school´s general courses. If students have achieved eligibility more than one year only the last year is counted.",
        "The distribution of the shares on the establishment variable does not add up to 100 per cent. This is due to the fact that a a few participants are not registered in Sweden at the time of the follow-up. However, these people are included in the number of eligible participants.",
        "X",
        "Data on disability are only available from 2018 and onwards. Before that, the number/proportion will be dotted.",
        "The numbers have been rounded to the nearest 5. Rounding can cause the total number to not always match the subtotals."
